 "title": "WildDet3D: Scaling Promptable 3D Detection in the Wild",
 "summary": "A unified geometry-aware architecture for open-vocabulary monocular 3D object detection from a single RGB image. It supports multi-modal prompts including text, points, and boxes, functioning as a promptable detector similar to SAM.",
 "research_notes": "Built on SAM 3 backbone and LingBot-Depth; achieves state-of-the-art zero-shot performance on Argoverse 2 and ScanNet.",
